# Always push so CI can check

Local `swift test` often cannot run (Command Line Tools only). Hosted Buildkite is the real runner.

After finishing a change on this repo:
- Commit it (this project overrides the default “only commit when asked”)
- `git push origin HEAD` so `origin/main` triggers Buildkite
- Do not leave finished work sitting in the working tree

Never replace the `origin` remote. Origin is `https://origin.cursor.com/catkins/scarlett-midi-remote.git`.
